Package: hafiye
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Hafiye Project <support@nousresearch.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3 (<< 3.14), python3-venv, systemd
Suggests: curl, ca-certificates, git, ripgrep, ffmpeg, libgtk-3-0, libnss3, libasound2 | libasound2t64, libgbm1, libnotify4, libxss1, libxtst6, xdg-utils
Description: Hafiye local-first desktop AI agent
 Hafiye is a maintained Hermes Agent fork with a persistent local gateway,
 desktop application, host tools, local model runtimes, and Turkish voice
 support. The package installs the Desktop shell and backend; managed model,
 speech, and computer-use runtimes are installed on first run when requested.
